  "d.1pg1xjs": "TRANSPORTAN",
  "d.1pptvj": "BASTION, magod hangara de meni pleda (nafakörp äsä pemekon pro 0.3.0 e pos; gretot jenöfik 256 x 128). Magod ekrana pleda, fomam 0.6.1",
  "d.1q40xi9": "LEVIATHAN, magod hangara de meni pleda (nafakörp äsä pemekon pro 0.3.0 e pos; gretot jenöfik 256 x 128). Magod ekrana pleda, fomam 0.6.1",
