  "footer.anthropicClaudeClaude": "Anthropic, Claude e Claude Code binons marks fabik ela Anthropic, PBC. Unreal Engine e Epic Games binons marks fabik ela Epic Games, Inc. Blender binon mark fabik ela Blender Foundation. Quake III Arena e Elite Dangerous binons marks fabik ledamanas onik. Nems valik tefons ledamanis onik e pagebons te ad bepenön produtis pelabölis. Orion-81 no binon kobiko, pelonöl u pedagetöl fa ek ona.",
  "footer.aspirationalNoPartnership": "Stedik. Kobajäf, kobam u dagetam nonik dabinon.",
